From 311f8b4ce13dd2b0be1cc681adc18fb808578291 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:02:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1234/3799] soh: rename D_801270B0 -> sUnusedDList

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the in-tree comment above it reads "// unused"; it is a complete render-mode setup display list with no reference anywhere.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_room.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_room.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_room.c b/soh/src/code/z_room.c
index aaa356417..4530c5f71 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_room.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_room.c
@@ -23,7 +23,8 @@ void Room_DrawImage(PlayState* play, Room* room, u32 flags);  // was func_80096F
 Vec3f D_801270A0 = { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };
 
 // unused
-Gfx D_801270B0[] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_801270B0: the in-tree comment above it reads "// unused"; it is a complete render-mode setup display list with no reference anywhere.
+Gfx sUnusedDList[] = {  // was D_801270B0 [LLM:HIGH]
     gsDPPipeSync(),
     gsSPClearGeometryMode(G_ZBUFFER | G_CULL_BOTH | G_FOG | G_LIGHTING | G_TEXTURE_GEN | G_TEXTURE_GEN_LINEAR | G_LOD),
     gsSPTexture(0xFFFF, 0xFFFF, 0, G_TX_RENDERTILE, G_OFF),
